// Template for Secrets.xcconfig. Copy this file to `Secrets.xcconfig`
// (which is gitignored) and fill in your proxy URL.
//
//   cp Secrets.example.xcconfig Secrets.xcconfig
//
// Base URL of the backend proxy that holds the Anthropic API key. The app NEVER
// embeds the key — it only calls this proxy. Leave empty to use the offline
// fallback coach.
//
// NOTE: xcconfig treats "//" as a comment, so escape the scheme's slashes with $():
//   COACH_API_BASE_URL = https:/$()/your-proxy.example.com
COACH_API_BASE_URL =
